        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Pou’ rui khaeng loumei tei ninga,",
            "Kap lak nimei mak ge;",
            "Kabiang kaphi loumei le bailoumei guai tei,",
            "Ningtou puinung kaap pui lu tei suanni.",
            "",
            "Adih su cho khaengloumei tei [2]",
            "Kandi Guloumeipu zai kan the tarou thang,",
            "Poubaomei nzaenghmei Pu rianra the.",
            "",
            "2. Juda nun rui ti theih khang tei,",
            "Ninglou bam pu sini;",
            "Ai mu ninglou makge Poubaomei nzaenghmei,",
            "Akhang rui nkhuaimei sulou kan the.",
            "",
            "3. Pou’ rui theihmei tei houlana,",
            "Meiguai neihlan bam e;",
            "Neihla makmei nun rui kabma kapumh puan pat,",
            "Tarou lung khou tei nzip lou kan the.",
            "",
            "4. Thau dat kan the kalloumei Pu,",
            "Baanthai ram nzuan khang;",
            "Olive chingru khou tei muangru khou ding lana,",
            "Gaipui ram nzuan the kanloumei Pu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
